[38;5;252m[1m## What the program is[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;10mc_src/src/main.c[0m is a one-value oracle: [38;5;10mscanf("%f", &x)[0m into an [38;5;10mx[0m initialized to [38;5;10m0.f[0m, then print the four bytes of that [38;5;10mfloat[0m's object representation as lowercase hex plus [38;5;10m\n[0m. stderr is always empty, exit status always 0. So every observable difference is a difference in the value [38;5;10mscanf[0m stored — or in whether it stored anything.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
That shapes the whole test design. Because [38;5;10mx[0m starts at [38;5;10m0.f[0m and a matching failure leaves the object untouched, a failed conversion is indistinguishable from converting [38;5;10m0[0m — [3munless[23m the input has a leading [38;5;10m-[0m. Failure prints [38;5;10m00000000[0m, success prints [38;5;10m00000080[0m. Every failure-path input in the suite is therefore also run with a [38;5;10m-[0m prefix.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;252m[1m## Bug found and fixed[0m[0m
[0m[0m
One real mismatch, in [38;5;10msrc/cfloat.rs[0m: a [38;5;10m0x[0m prefix followed by neither a hex digit nor a [38;5;10m.[0m.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
| input | C | Rust (before) |[0m[0m
| --- | --- | --- |[0m[0m
| [38;5;10m-0x[0m | [38;5;10m00000000[0m | [38;5;10m00000080[0m |[0m[0m
| [38;5;10m-0xp1[0m | [38;5;10m00000000[0m | [38;5;10m00000080[0m |[0m[0m
| [38;5;10m-0xg[0m | [38;5;10m00000000[0m | [38;5;10m00000080[0m |[0m[0m
[0m[0m
The translation modelled this as "[38;5;10mstrtof[0m converts just the leading [38;5;10m0[0m" and returned a signed zero. That is what a bare [38;5;10mstrtof("-0x")[0m does, but glibc's [38;5;10mvfscanf[0m collects the token itself and requires a digit or a decimal point [3mafter[23m the prefix; with neither it raises a matching failure and stores nothing, so [38;5;10mx[0m keeps [38;5;10m+0.0f[0m. The fix succeeds with a signed zero only when a [38;5;10m.[0m follows ([38;5;10m-0x.[0m → [38;5;10m00000080[0m, which I confirmed against the C binary), and reports failure otherwise.[0m[0m
